- Project Type: ASP.NET Core Web App (Model-View-Controller)
- Project Name: CollegePortalPWA
CollegePortalPWA/
│
├── Program.cs                                <-- Static files & routing middleware
├── wwwroot/
│   ├── manifest.json                         <-- PWA Manifest file
│   ├── service-worker.js                     <-- Service worker registration script
│   └── icons/
│       ├── picture-192.png                   <-- 192x192 app icon
│       └── picture-512.png                   <-- 512x512 app icon
└── Views/
    ├── Home/
    │   └── Index.cshtml                      <-- College information home page
    └── Shared/
        └── _Layout.cshtml                    <-- Links manifest.json & registers service worker

--- STEP 1: Views/Home/Index.cshtml ---
1. In Solution Explorer, expand the "Views" folder.
2. Expand the "Home" folder.
3. Double-click "Index.cshtml".
4. Delete all existing code and paste the code from FILE 1 below.
5. Save (Ctrl + S).

--- STEP 2: Create wwwroot/icons folder and add icons ---
1. In Solution Explorer, right-click the "wwwroot" folder.
2. Click "Add" -> "New Folder".
3. Name the folder: icons
4. Add any two PNG image files inside this folder and rename them to:
   - picture-192.png
   - picture-512.png

--- STEP 3: Create wwwroot/manifest.json ---
1. Right-click the "wwwroot" folder.
2. Click "Add" -> "New Item...".
3. Select "JSON File" (or Web -> JSON File).
4. Name the file: manifest.json
5. Click "Add".
6. Delete all default code and paste the code from FILE 2 below.
7. Save (Ctrl + S).

--- STEP 4: Create wwwroot/service-worker.js ---
1. Right-click the "wwwroot" folder.
2. Click "Add" -> "New Item...".
3. Select "JavaScript File".
4. Name the file: service-worker.js
5. Click "Add".
6. Delete all default code and paste the code from FILE 3 below.
7. Save (Ctrl + S).

--- STEP 5: Update Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml ---
1. In Solution Explorer, expand "Views" -> expand "Shared".
2. Double-click "_Layout.cshtml".
3. Inside the <head> tags, add:
   <link rel="manifest" href="~/manifest.json" />
4. Just before the closing </body> tag, add the service worker registration script block.
   (Or replace the entire file with FILE 4 below).
5. Save (Ctrl + S).

--- STEP 6: Verify Program.cs ---
1. Double-click "Program.cs" in your project root.
2. Ensure that "app.UseStaticFiles();" is present so files in wwwroot are served properly.
3. Save (Ctrl + S).


